[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12540.71, "timestamp": "03:29:00", "text": "还有更多路要走。不。是的。做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12550.309, "timestamp": "03:29:10", "text": "还有一个。还有一个。是的。是的。是的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.389, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "你好。现在，音乐部分我们来看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12559.11, "timestamp": "03:29:19", "text": "更新数据包。就是这个[音乐]。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12562.87, "timestamp": "03:29:22", "text": "现在，它奏效了。蓝色协议。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12565.429, "timestamp": "03:29:25", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12567.75, "timestamp": "03:29:27", "text": "完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.99, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "这真是完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.349, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "这个人。完美。现在你可能拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.349, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "意识到没有本地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.429, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "本地部分，对吧？原因在于此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12584.15, "timestamp": "03:29:44", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12590.63, "timestamp": "03:29:50", "text": "因为它包含在一次更新中。看？所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12593.59, "timestamp": "03:29:53", "text": "我觉得我必须做的就是[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12595.83, "timestamp": "03:29:55", "text": "所有更新。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12598.55, "timestamp": "03:29:58", "text": "所有更新都由我完成。"}]